  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Child is mapped as the speaker of the text about their missing father",
  "description": "The visual of the young Black boy is mapped onto the textual entity 'my dad' in the phrase 'my dad is the best at hide and seek'. The child, as the visual subject, is the speaker of the text, representing the child's perspective on their absent father. The mapping is established by the juxtaposition of the child's somber expression with the text, which implies the child is the one experiencing the absence and speaking about it. The child's visual presence anchors the entire narrative of the meme, making them the 'I' in 'my dad'.",
